     fhir:ImmunizationRecommendation.recommendation.description [ fhir:value "Vaccination based on individual-based decision-making- with an emphasis that the risk-benefit of vaccination is most favorable for individuals who are at an increased risk for severe COVID-19 disease and lowest for individuals who are not at an increased risk according to the CDC list of COVID-19 risk factors. see https://www.cdc.gov/covid/hcp/clinical-care/underlying-conditions.html\nFor people who have a history of myocarditis with MIS-C or MIS-A, see https://www.cdc.gov/covid/hcp/vaccine-considerations/special-situations-and-populations.html#cdc_clinical_guidance_recomm_key-covid-19-vaccination-and-mis-c-and-mis-a" ] ;
